sequenceDiagram
    actor utilisateur as Utilisateur
    participant panel as Home Panel
    participant api as Adaptateur API
    participant assistant as Assistant Application
    participant access as Identity Access
    participant routine as Routines Scenes
    participant control as Home Control
    participant ha as Adaptateur Home Assistant

    utilisateur->>panel: Prepare la routine coucher
    panel->>api: Message et contexte de session
    api->>assistant: Traiter intention
    assistant->>access: Verifier droits et contexte partage
    access-->>assistant: ActorContext
    assistant->>routine: Construire action proposee
    routine-->>assistant: Effets et confirmation requise
    assistant-->>api: ConfirmationRequest
    api-->>panel: Recapitulatif des effets
    utilisateur->>panel: Confirme
    panel->>api: Confirmation avec cle idempotence
    api->>routine: Executer action confirmee
    routine->>control: Appliquer chaque commande autorisee
    control->>ha: Commander appareil
    ha-->>control: Etat confirme ou erreur
    control-->>routine: Resultat par appareil
    routine-->>api: CommandResult
    api-->>panel: Resultat explicite
